 therapeutics for muscular dystrophies and serious cardiac conditions. The company's product candidates are Sevasemten, EDG-7500, EDG-003, and EDG-15400. Sevasemten is an orally administered small molecule designed to address the root cause of dystrophinopathies, including Duchenne muscular dystrophy (Duchenne) and Becker muscular dystrophy (Becker). The company's products are currently in different stages of their development, being developed to target key muscle proteins and modulators to address a broad array of muscle diseases.","desc_src":"Massive (formerly Polygon.io) ticker details","sic":"2834","sic_desc":"Pharmaceutical Preparations","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","mcap":4297465384.53,"mcap_src":"Massive ticker details (2026-10-09)","shares":108604129,"shares_src":"Massive ticker details (share-class shares outstanding)","hq":"BOULDER, CO","website":"https://www.edgewisetx.com","employees":127,"list_date":"2021-03-26","exchange":"XNAS","fy_end":"1231","cik":1710072,"state_inc":"DE","massive_asof":"2026-10-09","sec_asof":"2026-10-09"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"SEC EDGAR XBRL companyfacts","asof":"2026-10-06","q":[{"end":"2023-09-30","rev":null,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":-0.41,"eps_yoy":-20.6,"ni":-25713000.0,"ni_yoy":-46.9,"nm":null,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2023-12-31","rev":null,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":-0.47,"eps_yoy":-56.7,"ni":69919837.0,"ni_yoy":"turned +","nm":null,"derived":["eps","ni"],"fp":null},{"end":"2024-03-31","rev":null,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":-0.33,"eps_yoy":8.3,"ni":-28525000.0,"ni_yoy":-24.9,"nm":null,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-06-30","rev":null,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":-0.34,"eps_yoy":0.0,"ni":-31497000.0,"ni_yoy":-46.7,"nm":null,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-09-30","rev":null,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":-0.36,"eps_yoy":12.2,"ni":-34129000.0,"ni_yoy":-32.7,"nm":null,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-12-31","rev":null,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":-0.42,"eps_yoy":10.6,"ni":94017187.0,"ni_yoy":34.5,"nm":null,"derived